B.Ih=s(["Deployed 4 apps on the Google Play Store, 2 of which are also live on the Apple App Store.","Built the app using Clean Architecture with a feature-first, modular structure.","Used BLOC and Cubit for state management, with a coordinator BLoC that manages other BLoCs together.","Built a JWT refresh system that handles race conditions, ensuring only one refresh call is made during simultaneous failures instead of sending duplicate requests.","Added login with email/password, Google, GitHub, and Apple Sign In, unifying into one seamless login flow.","Set up deep linking for Android and iOS to ensure correct screen routing after login or from closed states.","Worked with NFC, building a feature to read and write data by tapping an NFC-enabled card or device.","Integrated real-time notifications via WebSockets with auto-reconnect logic for dropped connections.","Built realtime chat with instant rendering and deduplication against cache, fixing inflated unread counts.","Developed an offline scanner to read card QR codes and utilized on-device ML Kit OCR for contact extraction.","Added Apple Wallet and Google Wallet pass support, alongside QR code sharing for contacts."],t.s)
B.LQ=new A.be(B.hS,["Junior Flutter Developer","Ora Technologies","Kathmandu, Nepal","04/2025 \u2013 08/2026",!0,"Junior developer on the company's main flagship application, handling architecture, development, and release lifecycle from start to finish, including publishing to Google Play Store and Apple App Store.",B.Ih],t.R)
B.J1=s(["Built a task management app from scratch for a private server, where clients can post tasks to employees based on issues.","Used GET and POST APIs to send and fetch data between the app and server, with tasks shown in order and re-posted once fixed.","Iteratively refined UI responsiveness and fixed edge cases based on continuous QA feedback."],t.s)
B.LP=new A.be(B.hS,["Junior Flutter Developer","Medipro","Kathmandu, Nepal","01/2025 \u2013 04/2025",!1,"Engineered a task management application from scratch for a private server environment, enabling clients to post issues and track resolution timelines with employees in real time.",B.J1],t.R)
B.Ia=s(["Worked on real client projects (Castin.io) and mastered production Flutter development with mentorship from senior developers.","Built responsive UI components and app features, connecting REST APIs to fetch and display external data.","Assisted in writing project technical documentation, conducted unit testing, and participated in active code reviews."],t.s)
B.LO=new A.be(B.hS,["Flutter Developer Intern","EverestWalk Groups","Kathmandu, Nepal","03/2024 \u2013 07/2024",!1,"Contributed to live commercial client projects (Castin.io), collaborating closely with senior software engineers on component architecture and API integration.",B.Ia],t.R)
B.JP=s(["Worked with IoT devices and sensors to collect data, and built a simple Flutter app to display telemetry in real time.","Assisted in designing components of IoT devices and integrated IoT device APIs to fetch app data."],t.s)
