B.K4=s(["Architected using Feature-First Clean Architecture and BLoC (Cubit) with get_it dependency injection to strictly isolate UI from business logic and data layers.","Engineered a real-time booking engine and tournament management system using Firestore streams and Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM) to handle complex time-slot validations and deliver instant alerts.","Built an automated in-app OTA update system utilizing Dio and GitHub API to seamlessly manage background APK downloads and local installations.","Developed a role-based access control system via Firebase Auth to dynamically route users and administrators to customized, secure dashboards.","Designed a fully responsive, pixel-perfect UI architecture using flutter_screenutil to ensure flawless adaptability across all device dimensions."],t.s)
